            <ArticleTitle>Behavioral counseling, education at the core of new CAD management effort.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>154-7, 149</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>It may not be enough to stratify patients according to risk level. For the best outcomes, it may make sense to assess how motivated a person is to change his or her behavior. Find out how one organization is using such information in a pioneering effort aimed at taking disease management one step further.</AbstractText>
